//// emilia/tokens — the typed `Token` enum: the entire authored surface.
////
//// A consumer writes styles by LISTING typed tokens; never by writing CSS
//// strings. Each variant maps to a fixed CSS declaration via
//// `tokenToCss` (in `emilia.bp`). Unknown tokens are type errors at the
//// call site, not runtime fall-throughs.
////
//// SECTIONS (V0 — flattened into prefixed variant names):
////
////   Text   — TextBold / Italic / Underline / LineThrough / Left/Center/Right,
////            TextSize{Xs, Sm, Base, Lg, Xl, X2xl, X3xl}.
////   Color  — text color, fixed palette {Red500, Red700, Blue500, Blue700,
////            Gray500, White, Black} + ColorHex(string) escape.
////   Bg     — background color, fixed palette {Red500, Blue500, Gray100,
////            Gray900, White, Black} + BgHex(string) escape.
////   Pad    — padding, three axes: PadX{1,2,4,8,16}, PadY{1,2,4},
////            PadAll{1,2,4,8,16} — `1` = 0.25rem, `4` = 1rem, …
////
//// V0 SCAFFOLDING NOTE. The spec authors the surface as nested sections
//// with path access (`.Text.Bold`, `.Color.Red.500`, `.Pad.X.4`). That
//// shape requires the `enum-sections` language extension (v0.beta.20
//// frente-a keystone). Until enum-sections lands, this V0 enum encodes
//// the same logical sections via flat prefixed variant names
//// (`.TextBold`, `.ColorRed500`, `.PadX4`). The `tokenToCss` mapping +
//// the hashed-class / per-render flush mechanism stay identical when F1
//// re-shapes the enum.
////
//// V0 is intentionally narrow — F1 fills out Text/Font/Color/Bg/Pad/
//// Margin/Layout/Flex/Border/Effect + the modifier variants
//// (Hover/Focus/Active/Md/Lg/Xl). F0 ships just enough variants to
//// prove the shape and pin the `tokenToCss` / `flush()` contract.
////
//// LANGUAGE GOTCHA (encountered during F0): a line comment INSIDE an
//// enum body (between variant arms) trips the parser — section headers
//// must live in the file/module docblock (here), not between variants.

pub enum Token {
    TextBold,
    TextItalic,
    TextUnderline,
    TextLineThrough,
    TextLeft,
    TextCenter,
    TextRight,
    TextSizeXs,
    TextSizeSm,
    TextSizeBase,
    TextSizeLg,
    TextSizeXl,
    TextSizeX2xl,
    TextSizeX3xl,
    ColorRed500,
    ColorRed700,
    ColorBlue500,
    ColorBlue700,
    ColorGray500,
    ColorWhite,
    ColorBlack,
    ColorHex(value: string),
    BgRed500,
    BgBlue500,
    BgGray100,
    BgGray900,
    BgWhite,
    BgBlack,
    BgHex(value: string),
    PadX1,
    PadX2,
    PadX4,
    PadX8,
    PadX16,
    PadY1,
    PadY2,
    PadY4,
    PadAll1,
    PadAll2,
    PadAll4,
    PadAll8,
    PadAll16,
    Hover(inner: Token[]),
    Focus(inner: Token[]),
    Active(inner: Token[]),
    Md(inner: Token[]),
    Lg(inner: Token[]),
    Xl(inner: Token[]),
}
